@startuml GetProfileListForProfileNameAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
GetProfileListForProfileNameAsync – Retrieve Profiles by ProfileNameType
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "Profile" as profColl #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
   profileNameType 
end note

requestor -> profColl: (profileNameType)
activate profColl

profColl -> jd: read profile-collection
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> profColl: full profile-collection
deactivate jd

note over profColl
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Extract all profiles from profile-collection  
  - Filter profiles where profileNameType matches input  
  - Prepare response list of matching profiles  
  - Return empty array if none found
end note

profColl --> requestor: Array of Profile | []
deactivate profColl

@enduml
